 que más repiten se han mantenido en el mismo área. Verificar si los contratos al límite se repartieron de forma equitativa entre los adjudicatarios.","en":"What the data shows: Between 2023 and 2025, this body awarded 43 minor contracts for services and supplies above 14,000 and up to 15,000 euros, just under the legal limit. If those amounts were spread as in the band immediately below, 9.6 contracts would be expected. The observed-to-expected ratio is 4.5, with a 95% confidence interval of 2.9 to 6.9. December accounts for 9% of the contracts just under the limit, compared with 10% of all its services and supplies contracts. The contracts just under the limit are spread across 37 different awardees. Contract [1], for 14,522 euros, was awarded in November 2025.\nWhat it cannot show: The data shows that some contracts are just under the legal limit, but it doesn't prove any wrongdoing. This could be due to market prices or budget constraints, not necessarily improper actions.\nWhat can be checked: Check the dates and amounts of the contracts to see if they align with the body's needs. Also, review the awardees to ensure no single provider is favored. Contract [1] shows a specific example of a contract just under the limit.","origen_es":"modelo","origen_en":"modelo","modelo":"Qwen3-4B (Q4_K_M, llama.cpp)","regla":"ss","citas":["vrNlMkVV0HlSYrkJkLlFdw%3D%3D","L0T7nANtSAIaF6cS8TCh%2FA%3D%3D","ROk%2F6BBId6El5NjlNci%2BtA%3D%3D"],"generado":"2026-11-15"}}